# Unrelated scratch content living in this workspace directory — not part
# of the getbooqin-workspace npm workspaces, doesn't belong in the repo.
desgin/
my-tanstack-app/
scratch-recordings/
Repo connection needed.zip

# Credentials that were being kept as loose files in the repo root.
# rzp-test-key.csv was committed once and is removed here; because it is
# still in history, the key it held must be rolled at Razorpay — see the
# launch runbook. Nothing of this shape belongs in git: provider keys go
# in `fly secrets set` and a local .env, never a file a glob can pick up.
**/*-key
**/*-key.csv
**/*-key.txt
**/*secret*.csv
**/*credentials*.json
